senses.gloss:
चातन + .{@-नम्@}
—1 Tormenting, afflicting.
—2 Removing, scaring away.

चतुष्क + .{@-ष्की@}
—1 A large four sided pond.
—2 A mosquito curtain.

चतुर + .{@-रम्@}
—1 Cleverness, ingenuity.
—2 An elephantʼs stable.

चातुर्मास + .{@-सी@}
—1 N. of a sacrifice (इष्टि).
—2 The day of full moon at this sacrifice.
